{"unit_id":"MuYu-Zh__dsh-open-browser#card-zh","repo":"MuYu-Zh/dsh-open-browser","commit":"70b4257482e3354d6b13fdcf21494283431d45e8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-open-browser 是一个为 DSH Web UI 提供自动浏览器启动的插件。它通过 Cordis patch 注入 DSH，在 Web 服务器绑定并且启动流程就绪后读取本机端口并打开页面。插件会优先查找 Chrome 或 Chromium，在 Windows、macOS 和 Linux 上分别使用系统默认浏览器启动器作为回退；启动器缺失或启动报错时记录日志，不阻断 DSH。适合希望运行 dsh web 后直接进入页面、免去手动复制本地地址的用户。无需 API Key 或外部账号，需有可用浏览器启动器。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:94-112","cordis.patch.yml:1-3"]}
{"unit_id":"MuYu-Zh__dsh-open-browser#card-en","repo":"MuYu-Zh/dsh-open-browser","commit":"70b4257482e3354d6b13fdcf21494283431d45e8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-open-browser opens the local DSH Web UI after its server is ready. It prefers Chrome or Chromium, with platform browser launchers as fallbacks on Windows, macOS, and Linux. Launch errors are logged without stopping DSH. No API key or external account is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:94-112","cordis.patch.yml:1-3"]}
